  nonce: 4db1  # 4db1
  message: "Phase-1b-alpha MERGED (dev 1d8eb9f964). Grounded on the 2026-07-07 route-surfacing fundamental-concept audit (lab notebook route_surfacing_concept_audit_07072026.md; correctness_strategy + decision_register 2026-07-07 UPDATEs) which RATIFIED target-D and reshaped Phase 1b from a behavior-preserving rewrite into a BUG-FIX: it reproduced two silent bugs live. BUG-1 (route_of marker branch dropped framework) + BUG-2 (http.py + openapi.py concept-first _get_route_info_from_concept dropped path-less dual-carry routes / all marker-only routes from client->route + OpenAPI matching). Landed: route_of framework-UNION (route_framework -> meta['framework'] -> co-resident concept), persisted route_protocol read; registered route_path/http_method + added route_framework/route_protocol MetaKeySpecs (axis-gate + target-D(ii)); folded http.py + openapi.py extractors onto marker-first route_of and _get_route_symbols onto is_route (deleted dead _has_route_concept). 4238 tests pass, 100% cov changed sources.\n\nREMAINING (WI-tosul stays todo_hard):\n- entrypoints.py:496/1255 delegation DEFERRED: its raw WS-sentinel dispatch (entrypoints.py:518/1266) is coupled to the transport-protocol fold, filed as INV-tibap (WS/LIVE/RPC -> route_protocol axis + protocol_origin reconciliation + raw-sentinel consumer migration).\n- The COVERAGE-BREADTH monoculture (the actual 'dead-code 99% Python' root) is UNTOUCHED by the surfacing work: manifest-gating relaxation in refine_frameworks (profile.py:3143-3323, gate at 3074) so bare imports of route frameworks trigger concept enrichment — bounded (~1-5 lines) but bakeoff FP-calibration-gated (fastapi/django/flask/express safe; plug/grape/vapor/roda FP-prone). This is Phase 2, the high-leverage piece.\n- Phase 3: per-framework detection ratchet (WI-tolap-shaped), evidence-gated by growing tests/fixtures/route-parity.\n\nFiled this session: INV-vokak (dual-carry ROOT: enrich stamps redundant path-less concept, no guard), INV-tibap (protocol FOLD), WI-zunal (P4 http_method wildcard/aggregate cleanup). All tagged route_surfacing."  # 4db1
